        <body>
            <div xml:id="d11">

                <pb facs="0073" n="41" xml:id="pg41"/>

                <head>11. Memorandum From the Executive Secretary of the National Security Council
                    (Lay) to Members of the Council<anchor n="1" xml:id="d11-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1955-11-29"><hi rendition="#italic">November 29,
                        1955</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Review of Military Assistance and Supporting Programs</item>
                </list>
                <list type="references">
                    <head>REFERENCES</head>
                    <item>A. NSC 5434/1</item>
                    <item>B. NSC 5525, part 2</item>
                </list>
                <p>The enclosed draft NSC action on the subject, prepared by the NSC Planning Board
                    after review of U.S. military assistance and supporting programs pursuant to NSC
                    5434/1, is transmitted herewith for consideration by the National Security
                    Council at its meeting on Thursday, December 8, 1955.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d11-f2"/></p>
                <p>Also enclosed for the information of the Council is an Annex showing foreign aid
                    and other national security expenditures in FY 1955 and 1956 and the
                    distribution of foreign grant aid in FY 1955.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d11-f3"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">James S. Lay, Jr.</hi><anchor n="4"
                            xml:id="d11-f4"/></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d11-a1.xml" xpointer="d11-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
